    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d391">

                <pb facs="0499" n="411" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg411"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Griscom to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1904-02-05"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">February 5,
                    1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Griscom reports that warlike preparations are being rushed, and that it
                    seems that the Japanese Government has decided that it <pb facs="0500" n="412"
                        xml:id="pg412"/> has waited longer for an answer from the Russian Government
                    than is reasonable.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
